WEBVTT

00:00.671 --> 00:10.995
[SPEAKER_00]: All right, you follow the voices, and I can describe the passageways to you later, but basically you take a right and then a left, and you're crawling along the wall.

00:11.015 --> 00:11.895
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay, right.

00:12.175 --> 00:23.219
[SPEAKER_00]: A right, and then you turn left, and you come to what you think is a council room, right?

00:23.419 --> 00:25.379
[SPEAKER_00]: Because your homunculus can look into it.

00:27.920 --> 00:32.881
[SPEAKER_00]: And there's a big table that has like a map engraved in it.

00:33.001 --> 00:35.642
[SPEAKER_00]: And you realize it's a map of the Azure Seed.

00:35.782 --> 00:41.123
[SPEAKER_00]: So this is obviously the place where the admirals come and talk tactics or something like that.

00:43.564 --> 00:49.765
[SPEAKER_00]: In one of the seats in the room, you see Lord Fairwind sitting there.

00:52.916 --> 00:57.938
[SPEAKER_00]: Talking to two Suel, obviously, Toli people.

00:58.199 --> 00:58.559
[SPEAKER_00]: Toli?

00:58.979 --> 00:59.359
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

00:59.419 --> 01:00.660
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

01:00.680 --> 01:08.103
[SPEAKER_00]: And you hear Ferenwin say, Don't worry, they'll never be able to get through the defenses here.

01:08.323 --> 01:10.344
[SPEAKER_00]: Your hobgoblins will be able to keep them off.

01:10.724 --> 01:13.606
[SPEAKER_00]: If you think this attack will succeed, obviously it will not.

01:16.967 --> 01:17.908
[SPEAKER_00]: One of the Toli says,

01:20.710 --> 01:21.471
[SPEAKER_00]: We're not worried.

01:21.631 --> 01:25.053
[SPEAKER_00]: In fact, we think we have most of what we need from the caves below.

01:27.175 --> 01:34.580
[SPEAKER_00]: It seems, Lord Fairwind, that you've taken most of the chemicals for yourself.

01:36.962 --> 01:37.903
[SPEAKER_00]: We'll have the rest.

01:38.563 --> 01:44.588
[SPEAKER_00]: We'll take them to our island, to Kane Toli's island, Lord Fairwind says.

01:45.889 --> 01:47.670
[SPEAKER_00]: Our deal is still in place then.

01:50.849 --> 01:52.510
[SPEAKER_00]: You will vouch for me on the council.

01:54.191 --> 02:03.977
[SPEAKER_00]: Forcing Prince Jeon to give me more of the profits from his trade with the rest of the trader nations.

02:05.117 --> 02:11.101
[SPEAKER_00]: The Toli says, one of the Toli says, yes of course, you'll be well compensated.

02:12.221 --> 02:12.722
[SPEAKER_00]: After this

02:14.686 --> 02:20.269
