02:43.789 --> 02:44.610
[SPEAKER_01]: What do you realize?

02:46.131 --> 02:46.972
[SPEAKER_01]: What do I realize?

02:48.473 --> 02:50.134
[SPEAKER_01]: Are you asking me, like, what do I think?

02:50.575 --> 02:50.815
[SPEAKER_00]: Yeah.

02:52.757 --> 02:53.877
[SPEAKER_01]: About the chemicals?

02:55.499 --> 03:01.504
