03:07.205 --> 03:08.666
[SPEAKER_00]: I don't see a barrel full.

03:08.686 --> 03:10.287
[SPEAKER_01]: You don't see a barrel of this stuff, no.

03:10.648 --> 03:13.750
[SPEAKER_01]: But that's my most logical connection.

03:16.231 --> 03:17.272
[SPEAKER_01]: What did that stuff do again?

03:18.293 --> 03:19.234
