03:54.366 --> 03:56.628
[SPEAKER_00]: They got it from the Duke of Berghof.

03:57.088 --> 03:57.348
[SPEAKER_00]: Okay.

03:58.128 --> 04:11.576
[SPEAKER_00]: Now, the truth about this is this is a very big secret because everybody thinks that Helm Island has a magical enchantment that makes sure that the sahaugin cannot attack Monmurg.

04:11.836 --> 04:13.137
