04:32.625 --> 04:34.306
[SPEAKER_01]: Would Jeon be mad if I...

04:45.078 --> 04:52.561
[SPEAKER_01]: Do I think he would be upset if I had proven that it's not a spell, it's chemicals that's actually keeping them back?

04:52.761 --> 04:56.102
[SPEAKER_00]: Well, I mean, I don't think he wants you to yell it from the rooftop.

04:56.142 --> 05:01.344
[SPEAKER_00]: I mean, the problem with this stuff is the fact that the supply comes from Burkoff.

05:02.137 --> 05:03.057
[SPEAKER_00]: And it's a weakness.

05:03.238 --> 05:03.698
